{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1421339001:1":{"text":"하! 역시 위대한 리더 이나 님의 판단은 옳았어!","source_cn":"呵！伟大的伊娜领袖的判断果然从无错漏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EB9350DFA0CFC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421339002:1":{"text":"시대에 뒤떨어진 노인네가 외부인을 데리고 우리 드워프의 성역에 발을 들이다니!","source_cn":"可憎的守旧者果然引领着外来之民踏足我等矮人的圣域！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x736083333616CD44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421339003:1":{"text":"...음, 따지고 보면 사실 이곳은 뾰족귀의 구역이지만... 됐어, 너희랑 무슨 얘기를 하겠어. 못 들은 걸로 해.","source_cn":"……呃，照理说这里其实应该算是尖耳朵的地盘内……算了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1465AAC37B1F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421339004:1":{"text":"얘들아, 이나 안에 있어? 그리고 너희들은 이곳을 어떻게 발견한 거야?","source_cn":"孩子们，伊娜就在里面吗？你们怎么发现的这个地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A71E7486D3ECD94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421339005:1":{"text":"부흥을 향하는 희망의 빛이 우리를 이끌었고, 우리는 날개를 펴고 날아오를 것이다!","source_cn":"复兴的希望之光引领着我们，而我们将振翅腾飞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68373C6BD87E779D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421339006:1":{"text":"리더 이나 님의 연구가 비약적으로 발전해 우리의 강력한 힘을 더 강하게 해줄 거야!","source_cn":"伊娜领袖的研究突飞猛进，让我们本就强大的力量更加如虎添翼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5222166620BE6D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421339007:1":{"text":"자, 이 구시대적 배신자와 외부인에게...","source_cn":"来吧，给这些老旧的叛徒和外来人——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7D9F772B21BFFF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"자, 이 구시대적 배신자와 외부인에게...","female":"자, 이 구시대적 배신자와 외부인에게...","variant_male_record_index":"163761","variant_female_record_index":"163762","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421339008:1":{"text":"매운 맛 좀 보여주자고!","source_cn":"一点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56388F58703D085F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芝琳":{"text":"젤린","source":"芝琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布乔":{"text":"후치","source":"布乔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}